rs:NikolaTrivic_Starting_Direktor
        rdf:type            :SourcedEntity , :WorkConnection , bio:Relationship , :Connection;
        rdfs:comment        "Nova.rs (8 August 2025) calls him director of Starting in relaying the order to conduct an investigation, and the predecessor of the new director; since when he was director is not stated. The month of the end is inferred: Nova.rs reported his arrest on 1 August 2025 and, on 8 August 2025, that Starting had a new director appointed after that arrest; the day of the change is not stated. The arrest is mentioned only to explain the date."@en , "Nova.rs (8. avgust 2025) ga naziva direktorom firme Starting, kada prenosi naredbu o sprovođenju istrage, i prethodnikom novog direktora; od kada je bio direktor nije navedeno. Mesec kraja je izveden: Nova.rs je 1. avgusta 2025. javio njegovo hapšenje, a 8. avgusta 2025. da je Starting posle tog hapšenja dobio novog direktora; dan promene nije naveden. Hapšenje je pomenuto samo da objasni datum."@sr;
        :connectionEndDate  "2025-08"^^xsd:gYearMonth;
        :hasDocumentation   [ rdf:type            :RelatedData , :Documentation;
                              rdfs:comment        "Direktno, 8. avgust 2025, prenosi Nova.rs (nije nezavisna potvrda): 'direktor privrednog društva \"Starting\" d.o.o. iz Beograda'."@sr;
                              :hasDocumentStatus  vip:published;
                              :hasDocumentType    vip:newsArticle;
                              :hasDocumentURL     <https://direktno.rs/vesti/drustvo-i-ekonomija/627014/startign-malisa-nedeljkovic.html>
                            ];
        :hasDocumentation   [ rdf:type            :RelatedData , :Documentation;
                              rdfs:comment        "Nova.rs, 8. avgust 2025, prenosi naredbu o sprovođenju istrage: 'direktor privrednog društva „Starting“ d.o.o. iz Beograda'; 'hapšenja njegovog prethodnika'."@sr;
                              :hasDocumentStatus  vip:published;
                              :hasDocumentType    vip:newsArticle;
                              :hasDocumentURL     <https://nova.rs/vesti/biznis/firma-starting-postavila-novog-direktora-nakon-hapsenja-nikole-trivica>
                            ];
        :hasDocumentation   [ rdf:type            :RelatedData , :Documentation;
                              rdfs:comment        "Nova.rs, 1. avgust 2025: 'Suvlasnik firme Starting Nikola Trivić jedan je od 14 uhapšenih'."@sr;
                              :hasDocumentStatus  vip:published;
                              :hasDocumentType    vip:newsArticle;
                              :hasDocumentURL     <https://nova.rs/vesti/hronika/uhapsen-i-nikola-trivic-suvlasnik-startinga/>
                            ];
