rs:Best_Media_Team  rdf:type  foaf:Organization , foaf:Agent , :Company;
        rdfs:comment       "Kompanija osnovana 24. decembra 2025. koja kupuje i osniva lokalne medijske kompanije. Alo Media System je prvobitni vlasnik; Insajder Tim ulazi u vlasništvo u februaru 2026."@sr , "Company established on 24 December 2025 that acquires and establishes local media companies. Initially owned by Alo Media System; Insajder Tim acquired a stake in February 2026."@en;
