rs:Milan_Vukovljak  rdf:type  foaf:Person , foaf:Agent;
        rdfs:comment       "Vlasnik firme Bob, prema 021.rs (2025). Srna je 2021. u Glasu Srpske navela Milana Vukovljaka koji živi u Novom Sadu kao vlasnika firme „Bob“, bez sedišta firme i matičnog broja; da je to ista firma zasniva se na imenu, gradu i vrsti posla."@sr , "Owner of Bob, per 021.rs (2025). A 2021 Srna report in Glas Srpske names a Milan Vukovljak who lives in Novi Sad as owner of the firm \"Bob\", without the firm's seat or registration number; that it is the same firm rests on the name, the town and the kind of work."@en;
        :firstLastName     "Vukovljak";
        :hasDocumentation  [ rdf:type            :RelatedData , :Documentation;
