rs:SreckoKostov_ServiceForEfficientEnergy_Witness
        rdf:type              bio:Relationship , :SourcedEntity , :Connection;
        rdfs:comment          "Prema KRIK-u, čiji izveštaj prenose Vijesti, Srećko Kostov je kao svedok potpisao osnivačka dokumenta Tončevljeve kompanije Service for Efficient Energy 2010. i potvrdio Tončevljev identitet. Kostov je rekao da poznaje Tončeva, ali je negirao vezu sa firmom. Ovo je uloga svedoka osnivanja, bez tvrdnje o vlasništvu, zaposlenju ili političkoj funkciji."@sr , "KRIK, republished by Vijesti, identifies Srećko Kostov as a witness who signed the 2010 formation documents for Tončev’s Service for Efficient Energy and confirmed Tončev’s identity. Kostov acknowledged knowing Tončev but denied involvement with the company. This records his reported formation-witness role, without asserting ownership, employment or political office."@en;
        rdfs:label            "Svedok osnivanja"@sr , "Formation witness"@en;
        :connectionEndDate    "2010"^^xsd:gYear;
