rs:AssecoSEE_KancelarijaIT_RegistarStanovnistva
        rdf:type           :SourcedEntity , :Connection , bio:Relationship;
        rdfs:comment       "Na tenderu Kancelarije za IT i eUpravu za izradu Centralnog registra stanovništva, Asseco SEE je dobio ugovor vredan 180 miliona dinara (Radio Slobodna Evropa, Danas). Direktor Kancelarije Mihailo Jovanović rekao je 23. septembra 2020. da je Asseco dao najbolju od dve ispravne ponude i da je Kancelarija, znajući da je Igor Brnabić jedan od direktora kompanije, 14. novembra 2019. zatražila od Uprave za javne nabavke da se izjasni da li se ugovor može zaključiti. Izvori se ne slažu o datumu ugovora, pa nijedan nije zabeležen."@sr , "On a tender of the Office for IT and eGovernment for building the Central Population Register, Asseco SEE won a contract worth 180 million dinars (Radio Slobodna Evropa, Danas). The Office's director Mihailo Jovanović said on 23 September 2020 that Asseco gave the best of two valid bids, and that, knowing that Igor Brnabić was one of the company's directors, the Office had asked the Public Procurement Office on 14 November 2019 whether the contract could be concluded. The sources do not agree on the date of the contract, so none is recorded."@en;
        rdfs:label         "contract: Central Population Register"@en , "ugovor: Centralni registar stanovništva"@sr;
        :hasDocumentation  [ rdf:type            :RelatedData , :Documentation;
