rs:MalisaNedeljkovic_Starting_Direktor
        rdf:type              bio:Relationship , :Connection , :SourcedEntity , :WorkConnection;
        rdfs:comment          "Reported by Nova.rs on 8 August 2025 as the new director, appointed after the arrest of Nikola Trivić, which Nova.rs reported on 1 August 2025. The month is inferred from those two dates; the day of appointment and its source (registry or company) are not stated. Direktno carries the Nova.rs report and is not independent confirmation."@en , "Nova.rs je 8. avgusta 2025. javio da je on novi direktor, postavljen posle hapšenja Nikole Trivića, koje je Nova.rs javio 1. avgusta 2025. Mesec je izveden iz ta dva datuma; dan postavljenja i njegov izvor (registar ili firma) nisu navedeni. Direktno prenosi izveštaj Nova.rs i nije nezavisna potvrda."@sr;
        :connectionStartDate  "2025-08"^^xsd:gYearMonth;
        :hasDocumentation     [ rdf:type            :RelatedData , :Documentation;
